.TH MX-DOCKMAKER 1 "August 2026" "mx-dockmaker" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mx-dockmaker \- create and manage Fluxbox dock configurations for MX Linux
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mx-dockmaker
.RI [ dock-file ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mx-dockmaker
is a graphical utility that allows users to easily create, modify, and
manage docks on MX Linux with Fluxbox. It provides a user-friendly
interface for customizing dock appearance, adding applications, and
configuring dock behavior without requiring manual editing of
configuration files.
.PP
If
.I dock-file
is given, it is opened for editing on startup.
.SH SEE ALSO
Full documentation is installed in
.IR /usr/share/doc/mx-dockmaker/help .
